---------------------------- MODULE Inner ----------------------------
VARIABLES x, y, z

Init == /\ x \in {0, 1, 2}
        /\ y \in {0, 1, 2}
        /\ z \in {0, 1, 2}

Next == /\ x' = x + 1
        /\ UNCHANGED <<y, z>>

Spec == Init /\ [][Next]_<<x, y, z>>
=============================================================================